[
  {
    "displayName": "Archivist: p95 latency above 8 s",
    "severity": "WARNING",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "p95 /ask latency > 8000 ms (5 min)",
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/archivist_latency\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"archivist\"",
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_PERCENTILE_95"
            }
          ],
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 8000,
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "1800s"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "content": "Players are waiting more than 8 s for answers (normal p95 is about 3 s). Usually the UNC gateway is slow or rate-limiting, or instances are saturated. See runbook section **High latency**.\n\nRunbook: docs/RUNBOOK.md"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Archivist: gateway errors",
    "severity": "ERROR",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "failed questions > 3 (5 min)",
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/archivist_errors\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"archivist\"",
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
            }
          ],
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 3,
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "1800s"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "content": "Calls to the UNC AI Gateway are failing (key expired/revoked, quota exceeded, or gateway outage). See runbook section **Gateway errors**.\n\nRunbook: docs/RUNBOOK.md"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Archivist: attack spike",
    "severity": "WARNING",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "questions blocked by defenses > 10 (5 min)",
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/archivist_blocked\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"archivist\"",
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
            }
          ],
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 10,
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "1800s"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "content": "More than 10 questions were blocked in 5 minutes: someone is probably probing the defenses. Check which layer is firing (dashboard) and the logs. See runbook section **Attack spike**.\n\nRunbook: docs/RUNBOOK.md"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Archivist: HTTP 5xx responses",
    "severity": "ERROR",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "5xx responses > 5 (5 min)",
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/request_count\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"archivist\" AND metric.labels.response_code_class=\"5xx\"",
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
            }
          ],
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 5,
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "1800s"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "content": "The service is returning server errors. See runbook section **5xx errors / crash loop**.\n\nRunbook: docs/RUNBOOK.md"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Archivist: running at max instances",
    "severity": "WARNING",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "instances >= 5 for 5 min",
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"run.googleapis.com/container/instance_count\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"archivist\"",
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "60s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_MAX",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
            }
          ],
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 4,
          "duration": "300s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "1800s"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "content": "Autoscaling has hit its ceiling (max-instances=5) for 5 minutes, so new requests queue. Decide whether to raise max-instances (cost) or whether the gateway quota is the real limit. See runbook section **Scaling ceiling**.\n\nRunbook: docs/RUNBOOK.md"
    }
  },
  {
    "displayName": "Archivist: question volume spike (LLM spend guard)",
    "severity": "WARNING",
    "combiner": "OR",
    "conditions": [
      {
        "displayName": "questions > 300 (5 min)",
        "conditionThreshold": {
          "filter": "metric.type=\"logging.googleapis.com/user/archivist_requests\" AND resource.type=\"cloud_run_revision\" AND resource.labels.service_name=\"archivist\"",
          "aggregations": [
            {
              "alignmentPeriod": "300s",
              "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
              "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
            }
          ],
          "comparison": "COMPARISON_GT",
          "thresholdValue": 300,
          "duration": "0s",
          "trigger": {
            "count": 1
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "alertStrategy": {
      "autoClose": "1800s"
    },
    "documentation": {
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "content": "Over 300 questions in 5 minutes (about $0.20 of LLM spend per 5 min at $0.00064/question, 10x normal). Could be real traffic or abuse. See runbook section **Spend spike**.\n\nRunbook: docs/RUNBOOK.md"
    }
  }
]